AaveV4Adapter_deposit
  ├── when the caller is not the vault
  │   └── it should revert
  └── when the caller is the vault
      ├── when amount is zero
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when the Hub preview cannot mint an added share
      │   ├── it should buffer the deposit and emit DepositBuffered
      │   ├── it should not call or approve the protocol
      │   └── it should include the tracked buffer once in TVL
      ├── when the resulting previewed buffer equals the fifty-unit cap
      │   └── it should buffer the deposit
      ├── when the resulting previewed buffer exceeds the fifty-unit cap
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when a later deposit makes the aggregate supplyable
      │   └── it should supply the aggregate and clear the buffer
      ├── when the preview is nonzero but the Spoke returns InvalidShares
      │   ├── it should buffer only that exact error and clear the allowance
      │   └── it should revert if the resulting buffer exceeds the cap
      ├── when Aave reverts with any other payload
      │   └── it should bubble the exact revert
      ├── when the Hub preview reverts
      │   └── it should bubble the exact revert without buffering or approving
      ├── when clearing the allowance fails after a dust revert
      │   └── it should revert without recording a buffer
      ├── when assets are donated directly to the adapter
      │   └── it should exclude untracked donations from TVL
      ├── when the actual deposited amount is less than the amount supplied
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when TVL decreases during the deposit
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when the credited shortfall exceeds the rounding tolerance
      │   └── it should revert
      ├── when the credited shortfall equals the rounding tolerance
      │   └── it should succeed
      ├── when the credited amount exceeds the requested amount
      │   └── it should succeed
      └── when the actual deposited amount equals the amount supplied
          ├── it should emit a Deposit event
          └── it should supply USDC to the Aave V4 spoke
